| `child_env.login_name_schemes` | list of strings | `["git+ssh", "sftp", "ssh", "ssh+git"]` | URL schemes | `scripts/child_env.py`; `scripts/run_make_target.py` | In a listed scheme a URL user part counts as a credential only with a password; absent, the list is empty and its reader writes `[using default] child_env.login_name_schemes = []` to stderr. | any other scheme, where every user part counts | always |
